Editorial by Astrodeath        NannyMUD Times                         Page 2

  Welcome to the Spring 2010 issue of the NannyMUD Times.

  I would like to thank all the Journalists that make this paper possible,
  especially Hisashi, Kuruth, Candybarr, and Gemfibrozil for their submissions
  this month, and also Orin for proofreading.
  
  It has been almost two years since the last issue of the NannyMUD Times.
  As was my orignal intent with the NannyMUD Times and the Journalists Club,
  issues of the Times will be released based on article submissions from 
  other mortals and wizards. I will serve as the Editor and assemble
  the submissions.
  
  Articles to the paper can be submitted via mudmail to me, or at the
  newspaper stand.

  -Astrodeath, Editor-in-Chief                                   Page 2                                   
